":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117611","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117611","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117611.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117611.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-08T14:35:08Z"},"body":"## Summary\r\n- Fix incorrect jiggle bone orientation when parent Node2D is mirrored.\r\n- Add `reset_jiggle()` to allow resetting jiggle cache after abrupt changes (mirror flip/teleport), without affecting default behavior.\r\n\r\n## Issue\r\nFixes #117610\r\n\r\n## Reproduction\r\n1. Create a 2D character with Skeleton2D/Bone2D and add a SkeletonModification2DJiggle.\r\n2. Mirror the character by setting a parent Node2D scale to (-1, 1).\r\n3. Observe jiggle bones: before fix they keep pointing toward the pre-mirror direction.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n- Use node-based look_at\r\n- add reset_jiggle\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n[test2dskeleton.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26108514/test2dskeleton.zip)\r\n\r\n- Manual: scale (1, 1), (-1, 1), (-1, -1), (-1, 2), (0.2,1.0)\r\n- Manual: skew transform\r\n- All cases behave as expected.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117611/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117611/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}